L002_unterminated_string.cmm:3:13: lexical error: unterminated string literal
  |
3 |     let s = "hello;
  |             ^
what went wrong:
  This text starts with a quote but never ends.
how to fix:
  Add the closing quote on the same line. For text over several lines use
  triple quotes """...""" or '''...'''.
      """multi-line text"""
